rst exact: closed, CLOSED at 5000
rst in window: send ack 5000, ESTABLISHED at 5000
rst outside: none, ESTABLISHED at 5000
syn in window: send ack 5000, ESTABLISHED at 5000
syn with data: send ack 5000, ESTABLISHED at 5000
ack of unsent: send ack 5000, ESTABLISHED at 5000
ack in order: data 2, ESTABLISHED at 5002
close-wait rst in window: send ack 5000, CLOSE_WAIT at 5000
close-wait syn: send ack 5000, CLOSE_WAIT at 5000
fin-wait-1 rst in window: send ack 5000, FIN_WAIT_1 at 5000
fin-wait-2 rst exact: closed, CLOSED at 5000
syn-sent rst no ack: none, SYN_SENT at 5000
syn-sent rst wrong ack: none, SYN_SENT at 5000
syn-sent rst acks syn: error connection refused, CLOSED at 5000
syn-sent synack wrong ack: none, SYN_SENT at 5000
syn-sent synack acks syn: send ack 7001, ESTABLISHED at 7001
